UID:72dbf6862358aed7366a2abd0c295f84@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:THE WALKER WOODS DOUBLE LOOP The Walker Woods hike takes place
  on the Oak Ridges Moraine which was formed when a glacier retreated 10\,0
